      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Discovery Park, Seattle's largest park at 534 acres, wraps around West Point where a lighthouse guides ships into Elliott Bay.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
