      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Magnolia sits on a hilly headland overlooking Puget Sound, bounded by Salmon Bay to the north and the BNSF Railway to the east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnolia%2C_Seattle",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Magnolia Historical Society preserves the neighborhood’s past and hosts free online series and live readings for history lovers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
